# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this part of the lesson, we'll discuss the *fidelity* between quantum "
"states, which is a measure of their similarity — or how much they "
"\"overlap.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"このレッスンの章では、量子状態間の*忠実度*（fidelity）について説明します。忠実度は、状態の類似性、つまりどれだけ「重なっている」かを測る指標です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given two quantum state vectors, the fidelity between the pure states associated with these quantum state vectors equals the absolute value of the inner product between the quantum state vectors.\n"
"This provides a basic way to measure their similarity: the result is a value between $0$ and $1,$ with larger values indicating greater similarity.\n"
"In particular, the value is zero for orthogonal states (by definition), while the value is $1$ for states equivalent up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr ""
"2つの量子状態ベクトルが与えられた場合、それらの量子状態ベクトルに対応する純粋状態間の忠実度は、状態ベクトルの内積の絶対値に等しくなります。\n"
"これは類似性を測る基本的な方法です。結果は $0$ から $1$ の間の値をとり、値が大きいほど類似性が高いことを示します。\n"
"特に、直交状態に対しては（定義より）値はゼロになり、全体位相の差を除いて等しい状態に対しては値は $1$ になります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Intuitively speaking, the fidelity can be seen as an extension of this basic"
" measure of similarity, from quantum state vectors to density matrices.\n"
msgstr "直感的には、忠実度は量子状態ベクトルから密度行列への、この基本的な類似性の尺度の拡張と見なすことができます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Definition of fidelity {#definition-of-fidelity}"
msgstr "忠実度の定義 {#definition-of-fidelity}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It's fitting to begin with a definition of fidelity.\n"
"At first glance, the definition that follows might look unusual or mysterious, and perhaps not easy to work with.\n"
"The function it defines, however, turns out to have many interesting properties and multiple alternative formulations, making it much nicer to work with than it may initially appear.\n"
msgstr ""
"まず忠実度の定義から始めましょう。\n"
"次の定義は一見、奇妙あるいは謎めいて見えるかもしれませんし、扱いにくいと感じるかもしれません。\n"
"しかし、この定義が表す関数は多くの興味深い性質と複数の同値な表現形式を持つため、最初に見た印象よりもずっと扱いやすいことが分かります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Definition\">\n"
"Let $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ be density matrices representing quantum states of the same system.\n"
"The *fidelity* between $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ is defined as\n"
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}}.\n"
"$$\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"定義\">\n"
"$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ を同じ系の量子状態を表す密度行列とします。\n"
"$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ の間の*忠実度*は次のように定義されます。\n"
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}}.\n"
"$$\n"
"</Figure>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Remark\">\n"
"Although this is a common definition, it is also common that the fidelity is defined as the *square* of the quantity defined here, which is then referred to as the *root-fidelity*.\n"
"Neither definition is right or wrong — it's essentially a matter of preference.\n"
"Nevertheless, one must always be careful to understand or clarify which definition is being used.\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"注釈\">\n"
"これは一般的な定義ですが、忠実度をここで定義した量の*2乗*として定義し、ここで定義した量を*ルート忠実度*と呼ぶこともよくあります。\n"
"どちらの定義が正しくどちらが間違いというわけではなく、本質的には好みの問題です。\n"
"ただし、どちらの定義が使われているかを常に確認・明確化することが重要です。\n"
"</Figure>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make sense of the formula in the definition, notice first that "
"$\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}$ is a positive semidefinite matrix:\n"
msgstr "定義の式を理解するために、まず $\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}$ が半正定値行列であることに注目します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho} = M^{\\dagger} M\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho} = M^{\\dagger} M\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for $M = \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}.$\n"
"Like all positive semidefinite matrices, this positive semidefinite matrix has a unique positive semidefinite square root, the trace of which is the fidelity.\n"
msgstr ""
"ただし $M = \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}$ です。\n"
"すべての半正定値行列と同様に、この半正定値行列は一意の半正定値な平方根を持ち、その跡（トレース）が忠実度となります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For every square matrix $M,$ the eigenvalues of the two positive semidefinite matrices $M^{\\dagger} M$ and $M M^{\\dagger}$ are always the same, and hence the same is true for the square roots of these matrices.\n"
"Choosing $M = \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}$ and using the fact that the trace of a square matrix is the sum of its eigenvalues, we find that\n"
msgstr ""
"任意の正方行列 $M$ に対して、2つの半正定値行列 $M^{\\dagger} M$ と $M M^{\\dagger}$ の固有値は常に同じであり、したがってこれらの行列の平方根についても同様です。\n"
"$M = \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}$ と選び、正方行列のトレースはその固有値の和であるという事実を使うと、次のことが分かります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M^{\\dagger} M} = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M M^{\\dagger}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\sigma} \\rho \\sqrt{\\sigma}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{F}(\\sigma,\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\rho} \\sigma \\sqrt{\\rho}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M^{\\dagger} M} = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M M^{\\dagger}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\sqrt{\\sigma} \\rho \\sqrt{\\sigma}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{F}(\\sigma,\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"So, although it is not immediate from the definition, the fidelity is "
"symmetric in its two arguments.\n"
msgstr "つまり、定義からは直接分かりませんが、忠実度は2つの引数について対称です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fidelity in terms of the trace norm {#fidelity-in-terms-of-the-trace-norm}"
msgstr "トレースノルムによる忠実度の表現 {#fidelity-in-terms-of-the-trace-norm}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An equivalent way to express the fidelity is by this formula:\n"
msgstr "忠実度を表す同値な式として、次の式があります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\bigl\\|\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}\\bigr\\|_1.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\bigl\\|\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}\\bigr\\|_1.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we see the *trace norm*, which we encountered in the previous lesson in the context of state discrimination.\n"
"The trace norm of a (not necessarily square) matrix $M$ can be defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"ここで*トレースノルム*が現れています。これは前のレッスンで状態識別の文脈で登場したものです。\n"
"（必ずしも正方でない）行列 $M$ のトレースノルムは次のように定義できます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\| M \\|_1 = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M^{\\dagger} M},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\| M \\|_1 = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{M^{\\dagger} M},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and by applying this definition to the matrix $\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}$"
" we obtain the formula in the definition.\n"
msgstr "この定義を行列 $\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}$ に適用することで、定義中の式が得られます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An alternative way to express the trace norm of a (square) matrix $M$ is "
"through this formula.\n"
msgstr "（正方）行列 $M$ のトレースノルムの別の表現として、次の式があります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\| M \\|_1 = \\max_{U\\:\\text{unitary}} \\bigl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}(M U) \\bigr\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\| M \\|_1 = \\max_{U\\:\\text{unitary}} \\bigl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}(M U) \\bigr\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here the maximum is over all *unitary* matrices $U$ having the same number of rows and columns as $M.$\n"
"Applying this formula in the situation at hand reveals another expression of the fidelity.\n"
msgstr ""
"ここで最大化は、$M$ と同じ行数・列数を持つすべての*ユニタリ*行列 $U$ にわたって行われます。\n"
"この式を今の状況に適用すると、忠実度の別の表現が得られます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"= \\max_{U\\:\\text{unitary}} \\bigl\\vert\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}\\, U\\bigr) \\bigr\\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"= \\max_{U\\:\\text{unitary}} \\bigl\\vert\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{\\sigma}\\sqrt{\\rho}\\, U\\bigr) \\bigr\\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fidelity for pure states {#fidelity-for-pure-states}"
msgstr "純粋状態の忠実度 {#fidelity-for-pure-states}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One last point on the definition of fidelity is that every pure state is (as a density matrix) equal to its own square root, which allows the formula for the fidelity to be simplified considerably when one or both of the states is pure.\n"
"In particular, if one of the two states is pure we have the following formula.\n"
msgstr ""
"忠実度の定義について最後に1点補足しておくと、すべての純粋状態は（密度行列として）自分自身の平方根に等しいため、一方または両方の状態が純粋状態の場合、忠実度の式はかなり簡略化されます。\n"
"特に、2つの状態のうち一方が純粋状態の場合、次の式が成り立ちます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\bigl( \\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert, \\sigma \\bigr)\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\langle \\phi\\vert \\sigma \\vert \\phi \\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\bigl( \\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert, \\sigma \\bigr)\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\langle \\phi\\vert \\sigma \\vert \\phi \\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If both states are pure, the formula simplifies to the absolute value of the"
" inner product of the corresponding quantum state vectors, as was mentioned "
"at the start of the section.\n"
msgstr "両方の状態が純粋状態の場合、式は対応する量子状態ベクトルの内積の絶対値に簡略化されます。これは本章の冒頭で述べたことです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\bigl( \\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert, \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert \\bigr)\n"
"= \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\phi\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\bigl( \\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert, \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert \\bigr)\n"
"= \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\phi\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Basic properties of fidelity {#basic-properties-of-fidelity}"
msgstr "忠実度の基本的性質 {#basic-properties-of-fidelity}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The fidelity has many remarkable properties and several alternative formulations.\n"
"Here are just a few basic properties listed without proofs.\n"
msgstr ""
"忠実度には多くの注目すべき性質と複数の同値な表現があります。\n"
"以下にいくつかの基本的な性質を証明なしで挙げます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For any two density matrices $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ having the same size, the"
" fidelity $\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)$ lies between zero and one: "
"$0\\leq \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) \\leq 1.$ It is the case that "
"$\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)=0$ if and only if $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ "
"have orthogonal images (so they can be discriminated without error), and "
"$\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)=1$ if and only if $\\rho = \\sigma.$\n"
msgstr ""
"同じサイズの任意の2つの密度行列 $\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ に対して、忠実度 "
"$\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)$ はゼロから1の間にあります: $0\\leq "
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) \\leq 1.$ "
"$\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)=0$ となるのは、$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ "
"の像が直交する場合（すなわちエラーなしで識別可能な場合）に限り、$\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)=1$ となるのは "
"$\\rho = \\sigma$ の場合に限ります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The fidelity is *multiplicative,* meaning that the fidelity between two product states is equal to the product of the individual fidelities:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho_1\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\rho_m,\\sigma_1\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\sigma_m)\n"
"= \\operatorname{F}(\\rho_1,\\sigma_1)\\cdots \\operatorname{F}(\\rho_m,\\sigma_m).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"忠実度は*乗法的*です。つまり、積状態間の忠実度は個々の忠実度の積に等しくなります:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}(\\rho_1\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\rho_m,\\sigma_1\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\sigma_m)\n"
"= \\operatorname{F}(\\rho_1,\\sigma_1)\\cdots \\operatorname{F}(\\rho_m,\\sigma_m).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. The fidelity between states is nondecreasing under the action of any channel. That is, if $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ are density matrices and $\\Phi$ is a channel that can take these two states as input, then it is necessarily the case\n"
"that\n"
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) \\leq \\operatorname{F}(\\Phi(\\rho),\\Phi(\\sigma)).\n"
"   $$\n"
"4. The *Fuchs-van de Graaf inequalities* establish a close (though not exact) relationship between fidelity and trace distance: for any two states $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ we have\n"
"   $$\n"
"   1 - \\frac{1}{2}\\|\\rho - \\sigma\\|_1 \\leq \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"   \\leq \\sqrt{1 - \\frac{1}{4}\\|\\rho - \\sigma\\|_1^2}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The final property can be expressed in the form of a figure:\n"
msgstr "最後の性質は図の形で表すことができます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A plot relating trace distance and "
"fidelity](/learning/images/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-"
"information/purifications-and-fidelity/FvdG-plot.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![トレース距離と忠実度を関連付けるプロット](/learning/images/courses/general-formulation-of-"
"quantum-information/purifications-and-fidelity/FvdG-plot.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Specifically, for any choice of states $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ of the same system, the horizontal line that crosses the $y$-axis at $\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)$ and the vertical line that crosses the $x$-axis at $\\frac{1}{2}\\|\\rho-\\sigma\\|_1$ must intersect within the gray region bordered below by the line $y = 1-x$ and above by the unit circle.\n"
"The most interesting region of this figure from a practical viewpoint is the upper left-hand corner of the gray region:\n"
"if the fidelity between two states is close to one, then their trace distance is close to zero, and *vice versa*.\n"
msgstr ""
"具体的には、同じ系の状態 $\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ の任意の選択に対して、$y$ 軸を $\\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)$ の値で横切る水平線と、$x$ 軸を $\\frac{1}{2}\\|\\rho-\\sigma\\|_1$ の値で横切る垂直線の交点は、直線 $y = 1-x$ を下辺界、単位円を上辺界とする灰色の領域内に必ず存在します。\n"
"実用的な観点からこの図で最も重要な領域は、灰色の領域の左上隅です。\n"
"2つの状態間の忠実度が1に近ければ、そのトレース距離は0に近く、*逆もまた同様*です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Gentle measurement lemma {#gentle-measurement-lemma}"
msgstr "ジェントル測定補題 {#gentle-measurement-lemma}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next we'll take a look at a simple but important fact, known as the *gentle measurement lemma*, which connects fidelity to non-destructive measurements.\n"
"It's a very useful lemma that comes up from time to time, and it's also noteworthy because the seemingly clunky definition for the fidelity actually makes the lemma very easy to prove.\n"
msgstr ""
"次に、*ジェントル測定補題*（gentle measurement lemma）として知られる単純ですが重要な事実を見ていきましょう。これは忠実度と非破壊測定を結びつけるものです。\n"
"この補題は折に触れて登場する非常に有用な補題であり、忠実度の一見扱いにくそうな定義が実はこの補題の証明を非常に簡単にするという点でも注目に値します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The set-up is as follows.\n"
"Let $\\mathsf{X}$ be a system in a state $\\rho$ and let $\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$ be a collection of positive semidefinite matrices representing a general measurement of $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
"Suppose further that if this measurement is performed on the system $\\mathsf{X}$ while it's in the state $\\rho,$ one of the outcomes is highly likely.\n"
"To be concrete, let's assume that the likely measurement outcome is $0,$ and specifically let's assume that\n"
msgstr ""
"設定は次のとおりです。\n"
"$\\mathsf{X}$ を状態 $\\rho$ にある系とし、$\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$ を $\\mathsf{X}$ の一般測定を表す半正定値行列の集合とします。\n"
"さらに、状態 $\\rho$ にある系 $\\mathsf{X}$ にこの測定を行ったとき、ある結果が非常に高い確率で起こると仮定します。\n"
"具体的には、確率の高い測定結果を $0$ とし、特に\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho) > 1 - \\varepsilon\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0 \\rho) > 1 - \\varepsilon\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for a small positive real number $\\varepsilon > 0.$\n"
msgstr "が小さい正の実数 $\\varepsilon > 0$ に対して成り立つと仮定します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What the gentle measurement lemma states is that, under these assumptions, "
"the non-destructive measurement obtained from $\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$ "
"through Naimark's theorem causes only a small disturbance to $\\rho$ in case"
" the likely measurement outcome $0$ is observed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ジェントル測定補題が主張することは、これらの仮定のもとで、Naimarkの定理によって $\\{P_0,\\ldots,P_{m-1}\\}$ "
"から得られる非破壊測定は、確率の高い測定結果 $0$ が観測された場合に $\\rho$ に対してわずかな乱れしか与えないということです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"More specifically, the lemma states that the fidelity-squared between "
"$\\rho$ and the state we obtain from the non-destructive measurement, "
"conditioned on the outcome being $0,$ is greater than $1-\\varepsilon.$\n"
msgstr ""
"より具体的には、この補題は、$\\rho$ と非破壊測定によって得られる状態（結果が $0$ であることを条件とする）との間の忠実度の2乗が "
"$1-\\varepsilon$ より大きいことを述べています。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)^2 > 1-\\varepsilon.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)^2 > 1-\\varepsilon.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We'll need a basic fact about measurements to prove this.\n"
"The measurement matrices $P_0, \\ldots, P_{m-1}$ are positive semidefinite and sum to the identity, which allows us to conclude that all of the eigenvalues of $P_0$ are real numbers between $0$ and $1.$\n"
"This follows from the fact that, for any unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ the value\n"
"$\\langle \\psi \\vert P_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle$ is a nonnegative real number for each $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ (because each $P_a$ is positive semidefinite), together with these numbers summing to one.\n"
msgstr ""
"これを証明するために、測定に関する基本的な事実が必要です。\n"
"測定行列 $P_0, \\ldots, P_{m-1}$ は半正定値であり、恒等行列に和されます。このことから $P_0$ のすべての固有値は $0$ と $1$ の間の実数であることが分かります。\n"
"これは、任意の単位ベクトル $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ に対して、各 $a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ について値 $\\langle \\psi \\vert P_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle$ は非負の実数であり（各 $P_a$ が半正定値であるため）、これらの数の和が1になることから従います。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a = 0}^{m-1} \\langle \\psi \\vert P_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"= \\langle \\psi \\vert \\Biggl(\\sum_{a = 0}^{m-1}  P_a \\Biggr) \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"= \\langle \\psi \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 1.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a = 0}^{m-1} \\langle \\psi \\vert P_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"= \\langle \\psi \\vert \\Biggl(\\sum_{a = 0}^{m-1}  P_a \\Biggr) \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"= \\langle \\psi \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 1.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Hence $\\langle \\psi \\vert P_0 \\vert \\psi \\rangle$ is always a real "
"number between $0$ and $1,$ and this implies that every eigenvalue of $P_0$ "
"is a real number between $0$ and $1$ because we can choose "
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ specifically to be a unit eigenvector corresponding to"
" whichever eigenvalue is of interest.\n"
msgstr ""
"したがって $\\langle \\psi \\vert P_0 \\vert \\psi \\rangle$ は常に $0$ と $1$ "
"の間の実数であり、これは $P_0$ のすべての固有値が $0$ と $1$ "
"の間の実数であることを意味します。なぜなら、関心のある固有値に対応する単位固有ベクトルを $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ "
"として選ぶことができるからです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From this observation we can conclude the following inequality for every "
"density matrix $\\rho.$\n"
msgstr "この観察から、すべての密度行列 $\\rho$ に対して次の不等式が成り立ちます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{P_0} \\rho\\bigr) \\geq \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{P_0} \\rho\\bigr) \\geq \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In greater detail, starting from a spectral decomposition\n"
msgstr "詳しく述べると、スペクトル分解\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"P_0 = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"P_0 = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "we conclude that\n"
msgstr "から始めて、次のことが分かります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{P_0} \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle\n"
"\\geq \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle\n"
"= \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( \\sqrt{P_0} \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle\n"
"\\geq \\sum_{k = 0}^{n-1} \\lambda_k \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle\n"
"= \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl( P_0 \\rho\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"from the fact that $\\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle$ "
"is a nonnegative real number and $\\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\geq \\lambda_k$ for "
"each $k = 0,\\ldots,n-1.$ (Squaring numbers between $0$ and $1$ can never "
"make them larger.)\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\rho \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle$ は非負の実数であり、各 $k = "
"0,\\ldots,n-1$ に対して $\\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\geq \\lambda_k$ が成り立つことから従います（$0$ "
"から $1$ の間の数を2乗しても大きくなることはありません）。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we can prove the gentle measurement lemma by evaluating the fidelity and then using our inequality.\n"
"First, let's simplify the expression we're interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"さて、忠実度を評価し、この不等式を使用することで、ジェントル測定補題を証明できます。\n"
"まず、関心のある式を簡略化しましょう。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\Biggl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\Biggr)^2}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Biggl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"& = \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\sqrt{\\Biggl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\Biggr)^2}\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Biggl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{P_0}\\sqrt{\\rho}}{\n"
"\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"& = \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice that these are all equalities — we've not used our inequality (or any other inequality) at this point, so we have an exact expression for the fidelity.\n"
"We can now use our inequality to conclude\n"
msgstr ""
"これらはすべて等式であることに注意してください。この時点では不等式（および他のいかなる不等式も）を使用していないため、忠実度の正確な表現が得られています。\n"
"ここで不等式を適用すると、次のことが分かります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)\n"
"= \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"\\geq \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)\n"
"= \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"\\geq \\frac{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr)}{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}}\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and therefore, by squaring both sides,\n"
msgstr "したがって、両辺を2乗すると、\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)^2\n"
"\\geq \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr) > 1-\\varepsilon.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{F}\\Biggl(\\rho,\\frac{\\sqrt{P_0}\\rho\\sqrt{P_0}}{\\operatorname{Tr}(P_0\\rho)}\\Biggr)^2\n"
"\\geq \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(P_0\\rho\\bigr) > 1-\\varepsilon.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Uhlmann's theorem {#uhlmanns-theorem}"
msgstr "Uhlmannの定理 {#uhlmanns-theorem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To conclude the lesson, we'll take a look at *Uhlmann's theorem*, which is a fundamental fact about the fidelity that connects it with the notion of a purification.\n"
"What the theorem says, in simple terms, is that the fidelity between any two quantum states is equal to the *maximum* inner product (in absolute value) between two purifications of those states.\n"
msgstr ""
"レッスンの最後に、*Uhlmannの定理*（Uhlmann's theorem）を見ていきましょう。これは忠実度に関する基本的な事実であり、忠実度と精製の概念を結びつけるものです。\n"
"この定理が単純な言葉で述べていることは、任意の2つの量子状態間の忠実度は、それらの状態の精製の（絶対値での）内積の*最大値*に等しいということです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Theorem\">\n"
"Uhlmann's theorem: Let $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ be density matrices representing states of a system $\\mathsf{X},$ and let $\\mathsf{Y}$ be a system having at least as many classical states as $\\mathsf{X}.$ The fidelity between $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ is given by\n"
"$$\n"
" \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\max\\bigl\\{ \\vert \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\vert \\,:\\, \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert\\bigr) = \\rho,\\; \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigl(\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\\bigr) = \\sigma\\bigr\\},\n"
"$$\n"
"where the maximum is taken over all quantum state vectors $\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ and $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ of $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"定理\">\n"
"Uhlmannの定理: $\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ を系 $\\mathsf{X}$ の状態を表す密度行列とし、$\\mathsf{Y}$ を $\\mathsf{X}$ と少なくとも同じ数の古典状態を持つ系とします。$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ の間の忠実度は次のように与えられます。\n"
"$$\n"
" \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma) = \\max\\bigl\\{ \\vert \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\vert \\,:\\, \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi\\rangle\\langle\\phi\\vert\\bigr) = \\rho,\\; \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigl(\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\\bigr) = \\sigma\\bigr\\},\n"
"$$\n"
"ここで最大化は $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ のすべての量子状態ベクトル $\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ と $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ にわたって行われます。\n"
"</Figure>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can prove this theorem using the unitary equivalence of purifications — "
"but it isn't completely straightforward and we'll make use of a trick along "
"the way.\n"
msgstr "この定理は精製のユニタリ同値性を使って証明できますが、完全に直線的ではなく、途中で一つのトリックを利用します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, consider spectral decompositions of the two density matrices "
"$\\rho$ and $\\sigma.$\n"
msgstr "始めに、2つの密度行列 $\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ のスペクトル分解を考えます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\rho & = \\sum_{a = 0}^{n-1} p_a \\vert u_a\\rangle\\langle u_a\\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\sigma & = \\sum_{b = 0}^{n-1} q_b \\vert v_b\\rangle\\langle v_b\\vert\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\rho & = \\sum_{a = 0}^{n-1} p_a \\vert u_a\\rangle\\langle u_a\\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\sigma & = \\sum_{b = 0}^{n-1} q_b \\vert v_b\\rangle\\langle v_b\\vert\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The two collections $\\{\\vert u_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"u_{n-1}\\rangle\\}$ and $\\{\\vert v_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"v_{n-1}\\rangle\\}$ are orthonormal bases of eigenvectors of $\\rho$ and "
"$\\sigma,$ respectively, and $p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}$ and $q_0,\\ldots,q_{n-1}$"
" are the corresponding eigenvalues.\n"
msgstr ""
"2つの集合 $\\{\\vert u_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert u_{n-1}\\rangle\\}$ と "
"$\\{\\vert v_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert v_{n-1}\\rangle\\}$ は、それぞれ $\\rho$ と "
"$\\sigma$ の固有ベクトルの正規直交基底であり、$p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}$ と $q_0,\\ldots,q_{n-1}$ "
"は対応する固有値です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We'll also define $\\vert \\overline{u_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{u_{n-1}}\\rangle$ and\n"
"$\\vert \\overline{v_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{v_{n-1}}\\rangle$ to be the vectors obtained by taking the complex conjugate of each entry of $\\vert u_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert u_{n-1}\\rangle$ and $\\vert v_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert v_{n-1}\\rangle.$\n"
"That is, for an arbitrary vector $\\vert w\\rangle$ we can define $\\vert\\overline{w}\\rangle$ according to the following equation for each $c\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"また、$\\vert \\overline{u_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{u_{n-1}}\\rangle$ と $\\vert \\overline{v_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{v_{n-1}}\\rangle$ を、$\\vert u_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert u_{n-1}\\rangle$ と $\\vert v_0 \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert v_{n-1}\\rangle$ の各成分の複素共役をとることで得られるベクトルとして定義します。\n"
"すなわち、任意のベクトル $\\vert w\\rangle$ に対して、各 $c\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ について次の式に従って $\\vert\\overline{w}\\rangle$ を定義します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle c \\vert \\overline{w}\\rangle = \\overline{\\langle c \\vert w\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle c \\vert \\overline{w}\\rangle = \\overline{\\langle c \\vert w\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice that for any two vectors $\\vert u\\rangle$ and $\\vert v\\rangle$ we have\n"
"$\\langle \\overline{u} \\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle = \\langle v\\vert u\\rangle.$\n"
"More generally, for any square matrix $M$ we have the following formula.\n"
msgstr ""
"任意の2つのベクトル $\\vert u\\rangle$ と $\\vert v\\rangle$ に対して\n"
"$\\langle \\overline{u} \\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle = \\langle v\\vert u\\rangle$ が成り立つことに注意してください。\n"
"より一般的に、任意の正方行列 $M$ に対して次の式が成り立ちます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\overline{u} \\vert M \\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle = \\langle v\\vert M^T \\vert u\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\overline{u} \\vert M \\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle = \\langle v\\vert M^T \\vert u\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It follows that $\\vert u\\rangle$ and $\\vert v\\rangle$ are orthogonal if and only if $\\vert \\overline{u}\\rangle$ and $\\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle$ are orthogonal, and therefore\n"
"$\\{\\vert \\overline{u_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{u_{n-1}}\\rangle\\}$ and\n"
"$\\{\\vert \\overline{v_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{v_{n-1}}\\rangle\\}$ are both orthonormal bases.\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\vert u\\rangle$ と $\\vert v\\rangle$ が直交するのは、$\\vert "
"\\overline{u}\\rangle$ と $\\vert \\overline{v}\\rangle$ "
"が直交する場合に限ることが分かり、したがって $\\{\\vert \\overline{u_0} \\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\overline{u_{n-1}}\\rangle\\}$ と $\\{\\vert \\overline{v_0} "
"\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\overline{v_{n-1}}\\rangle\\}$ はともに正規直交基底です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now consider the following two vectors $\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ and "
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ which are purifications of $\\rho$ and $\\sigma,$ "
"respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"次に、$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ それぞれの精製である以下の2つのベクトル $\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ と "
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ を考えます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\phi\\rangle & = \\sum_{a = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a}\\, \\vert u_a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\overline{u_a}\\rangle \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\vert\\psi\\rangle & = \\sum_{b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\vert v_b\\rangle \\otimes \\vert\n"
"\\overline{v_b}\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\phi\\rangle & = \\sum_{a = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a}\\, \\vert u_a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\overline{u_a}\\rangle \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\vert\\psi\\rangle & = \\sum_{b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\vert v_b\\rangle \\otimes \\vert\n"
"\\overline{v_b}\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is the trick referred to previously.\n"
"Nothing indicates explicitly at this point that it's a good idea to make these particular choices for purifications of $\\rho$ and $\\sigma,$ but they are valid purifications, and the complex conjugations will allow the algebra to work out the way we need.\n"
msgstr ""
"これが前述のトリックです。\n"
"この時点では、$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ の精製としてこの特定の選択が良いことを明示的に示すものは何もありませんが、これらは有効な精製であり、複素共役の操作によって代数計算が必要な形で成立します。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By the unitary equivalence of purifications, we know that every purification of $\\rho$ for the pair of systems $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ must take the form\n"
"$(\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\\otimes U)\\vert\\phi\\rangle$ for some unitary matrix $U,$ and likewise every purification of $\\sigma$ for the pair $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ must take the form\n"
"$(\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\\otimes V)\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ for some unitary matrix $V.$\n"
"The inner product of two such purifications can be simplified as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"精製のユニタリ同値性により、系のペア $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ に対する $\\rho$ のすべての精製は $(\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\\otimes U)\\vert\\phi\\rangle$（ある種のユニタリ行列 $U$ に対して）の形をとり、同様に $\\sigma$ のすべての精製は $(\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\\otimes V)\\vert\\psi\\rangle$（ある種のユニタリ行列 $V$ に対して）の形をとることが分かります。\n"
"そのような2つの精製の内積は次のように簡略化できます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\phi \\vert (\\mathbb{I}\\otimes U^{\\dagger}) (\\mathbb{I}\\otimes V) \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"\\hspace{-2.5cm}\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle \\overline{u_a} \\vert U^{\\dagger} V \\vert \\overline{v_b} \\rangle \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle v_b \\vert (U^{\\dagger} V)^T \\vert u_a \\rangle \\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Biggl(\n"
"\\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\vert u_a \\rangle\\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle v_b \\vert (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\phi \\vert (\\mathbb{I}\\otimes U^{\\dagger}) (\\mathbb{I}\\otimes V) \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"\\hspace{-2.5cm}\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle \\overline{u_a} \\vert U^{\\dagger} V \\vert \\overline{v_b} \\rangle \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle v_b \\vert (U^{\\dagger} V)^T \\vert u_a \\rangle \\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Biggl(\n"
"\\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\sqrt{p_a} \\sqrt{q_b}\\, \\vert u_a \\rangle\\langle u_a \\vert v_b \\rangle\n"
"\\langle v_b \\vert (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"& = \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As $U$ and $V$ range over all possible unitary matrices, the matrix $(U^{\\dagger} V)^T$ also ranges over all possible unitary matrices.\n"
"Thus, maximizing the absolute value of the inner product of two purifications of $\\rho$ and $\\sigma$ yields the following equation.\n"
msgstr ""
"$U$ と $V$ がすべての可能なユニタリ行列にわたって変化するとき、行列 $(U^{\\dagger} V)^T$ もすべての可能なユニタリ行列にわたって変化します。\n"
"したがって、$\\rho$ と $\\sigma$ の2つの精製の内積の絶対値を最大化すると、次の式が得られます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{U,V\\:\\text{unitary}} \\biggl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Bigr)\\biggr\\vert\n"
"& = \\max_{W\\:\\text{unitary}} \\biggl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, W\\Bigr)\\biggr\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\bigl\\| \\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma} \\bigr\\|_1\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{U,V\\:\\text{unitary}} \\biggl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, (U^{\\dagger} V)^T\\Bigr)\\biggr\\vert\n"
"& = \\max_{W\\:\\text{unitary}} \\biggl\\vert \\operatorname{Tr}\\Bigl(\n"
"\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma}\\, W\\Bigr)\\biggr\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\bigl\\| \\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{\\sigma} \\bigr\\|_1\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\operatorname{F}(\\rho,\\sigma)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

